Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.96,0:00:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The world's always been\Nmore beautiful in your mind, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.83,0:01:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,ONE HUNDRED YEARS OF SOLITUDE
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.33,0:01:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He had been\Naround the world 65 times…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.29,0:01:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,…enlisted in a crew of expatriate sailors.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.63,0:01:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He had been shipwrecked
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.58,0:01:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and spent two weeks adrift\Nin the Sea of Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.83,0:01:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Our ship sank in a storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.88,0:01:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Another sailor and I\Nwere adrift for several days,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.08,0:01:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,holding on to a piece of wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.17,0:01:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh! I was the only one who survived.\NMm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.75,0:02:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But there were two of you.\NWhat happened to the other one?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.25,0:02:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He succumbed to heatstroke.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.79,0:02:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. But he saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.04,0:02:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,His flesh… was salty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.08,0:02:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It was delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.83,0:02:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And sweet too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.00,0:02:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Úrsula wept at the table
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.75,0:02:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,as if she were reading the letters\Nthat never arrived…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.67,0:02:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,…in which José Arcadio told her\Nabout his triumphs and misfortunes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.75,0:02:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You've always had a house here, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.67,0:02:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And we've had so much food to spare here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.17,0:02:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,When you disappeared,\NI went running after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.83,0:02:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I walked down every single path\Nuntil there were no more left to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.83,0:02:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Until I was out of ideas\Nof where to find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.50,0:02:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So, who's this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.17,0:02:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello. I am Pietro Crespi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.96,0:02:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Rebeca's fiancé.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.29,0:03:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.08,0:03:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Your sister, Rebeca.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.79,0:03:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.00,0:03:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,José Arcadio…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.08,0:03:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Where were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.42,0:03:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.00,0:03:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I moved to\Nthe second floor after I got married.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.96,0:04:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And Arcadio used to stay in here\Nuntil he left the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.83,0:04:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Arcadio?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.54,0:04:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.29,0:04:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always remember
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.21,0:04:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,when you'd come back at dawn\Nafter sneaking out of our room,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.75,0:04:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and then you'd tell me\Nall about your adventures.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.38,0:04:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Then one time, I decided to ask you…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.83,0:04:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,about what all of that felt like.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.83,0:04:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And then you said,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.63,0:04:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,"It's like the whole world is shaking."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.88,0:04:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You were right. Do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.83,0:04:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's enough for you to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.54,0:04:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you got married, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.92,0:05:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I got married.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.17,0:05:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm a widower.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.25,0:05:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,End of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.92,0:05:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, and Catarino's?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.92,0:05:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That still exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.25,0:05:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, pour me another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.67,0:05:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,José Arcadio ordered music\Nand aguardiente for everyone on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.79,0:05:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.08,0:05:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,His monumental body
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.58,0:05:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,instilled a frenzy of curiosity\Namong the women.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.21,0:05:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.92,0:06:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He proposed\Nraffling himself off to the women
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.67,0:06:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,for ten pesos a ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.58,0:06:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,An exorbitant price…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.13,0:06:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All right…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.04,0:06:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,…as the most popular woman\Nearned eight pesos a night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.96,0:06:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Teresa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.63,0:06:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But they all accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.75,0:06:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.00,0:06:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.79,0:06:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.88,0:06:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Make way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.42,0:06:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Make way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.54,0:06:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.33,0:06:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.58,0:06:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're aware
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.25,0:07:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,that it is almost time for\Nour first-ever elections here in Macondo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.29,0:07:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting today up until election day,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.50,0:07:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,there will be a curfew in place
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.08,0:07:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,from 8:00 in the evening\Ntill 6:00 in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.17,0:07:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, the sale and consumption
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.42,0:07:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,of any alcoholic beverages\Nwill be prohibited,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.42,0:07:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,as well as gatherings\Nof more than three people
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.08,0:07:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,who are not from the same family.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.50,0:07:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Arcadio resorted\Nto the only person
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.50,0:07:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,that had foreseen the abuse\Nof the Conservative regime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.50,0:07:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-Who is it?\N-Arcadio. The school director.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.25,0:07:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.58,0:07:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The things you said would happen\Nare happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.13,0:07:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta act now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.50,0:08:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor Alirio Noguera\Nhad arrived in Macondo a short while ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.21,0:08:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,carrying a medicinal kit\Nof tasteless globules
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.25,0:08:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,and a diploma\Nfrom the University of Leipzig
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.21,0:08:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,that he had forged himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.67,0:08:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Behind the innocent facade\Nof an unprestigious doctor,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.13,0:08:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,hid a terrorist.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.54,0:08:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this one doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.96,0:08:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-He's the mayor's little pawn.\N-I'm not anyone's pawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.50,0:08:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, all right.\NSettle down, settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.92,0:08:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He's one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.58,0:08:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Those little bottles\Nfull of white globules
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.17,0:08:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,were the symbol of an uprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.33,0:08:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.46,0:09:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.33,0:09:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Marry again, my boy.\NI have six daughters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.29,0:09:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There's rumors\Nin the capital of the province
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.50,0:09:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,that say the liberals\Nare willing to go to war.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.54,0:09:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what are their reasons?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.17,0:09:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't need any reasons, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.67,0:09:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Liberals are ill-tempered individuals.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.92,0:09:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Supporting the murder of priests,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.33,0:09:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,civil marriage, and divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.63,0:09:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And they argue illegitimate children
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.46,0:09:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,should have equal rights\Nto legitimate ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.96,0:09:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're aware of what I think\Nabout illegitimate children.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.25,0:09:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.71,0:09:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Aureliano José has\Nhis father's Buendía name.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.67,0:09:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And the name Moscote like his mother.\NIt's very different.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.96,0:09:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is, sir, none of those matters\Nappeal to me even in the least.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.33,0:09:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they should, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.96,0:10:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now more than ever,\Nit's better to stay on the winning side.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.75,0:10:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.79,0:10:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we are\Nagainst utilitarianism.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.25,0:10:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr. Noguera made contact\Nwith the young people in town
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.38,0:10:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,who were not well-versed in politics.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.21,0:10:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,…the secular state.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.58,0:10:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And embarked on\Na stealthy campaign of instigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.13,0:10:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody here ever\Ntalked about politics or parties.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.42,0:10:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but your parents and grandparents\Nfounded Macondo
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.83,0:10:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,based on the same principles\Nas the Liberal Party.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.50,0:11:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I come from Riohacha.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.46,0:11:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for Doctor Noguera.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.75,0:11:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Doctor Noguera.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.04,0:11:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,General Medina has sent\Nthe shipment you requested.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.92,0:11:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.67,0:11:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.46,0:11:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the proximity\Nof the elections
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.71,0:11:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,that sparked\Nthe flame of subversion in Doctor Noguera.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.50,0:12:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost every child\Nof the founders became involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.25,0:12:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And even though none of them knew exactly\Nwhat their plan consisted of,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.75,0:12:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,most were enthusiastic
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.88,0:12:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,about the idea of eliminating\Nthe Conservative establishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.17,0:12:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,FREE AND SOVEREIGN MACONDO\NVOTE RED VOTE LIBERAL
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.67,0:12:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm voting with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.83,0:12:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends, we musn't let\Nthe Conservatives rob the elections.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.33,0:12:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And Arcadio was growing\Nmore and more excited
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.83,0:12:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,over the prospect\Nof an imminent revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.88,0:12:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Here. Pass these out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.63,0:12:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Free and Sovereign. Right here, see?\N-Right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.08,0:12:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.54,0:12:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,There was talk\Nof executing Father Nicanor,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.88,0:12:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,of turning the church into a school,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.58,0:12:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and instituting free love.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.96,0:12:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,VOTE BLUE FOR PRESIDENT\NVOTE FOR THE CONSERVATIVE PARTY
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.50,0:13:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,FREE AND SOVEREIGN MACONDO\NVOTE RED VOTE LIBERAL
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.33,0:14:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That morning when she saw him…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.42,0:14:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,…Rebeca thought of Pietro Crespi\Nas a foppish weakling
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.04,0:14:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,when compared to that superior being\Nwhose volcanic breathing could be heard
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.04,0:14:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,throughout the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.50,0:14:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no right to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.92,0:14:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand? Understand what?\NThere's nothing I need to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.29,0:14:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't leave me without those knives!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,These are orders from the mayor,\Nall right lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.46,0:14:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah? Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.17,0:14:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Well, the mayor will listen\Nto what I have to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.67,0:14:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-And now how am I supposed to work? Huh?\N-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.79,0:14:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, young man. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.00,0:14:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop that!\NWhat are you doing in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.83,0:14:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?\NThere's nothing to look at in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.50,0:14:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you rummage through\Nour things like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.00,0:14:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Young man! Don't you test my patience!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.04,0:15:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-Orders are orders!\N-Don't test my patience!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.63,0:15:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I am warning you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.58,0:15:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Young man, give me back my knives!\NI'm warning you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.33,0:15:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have them back\Nonce the elections are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.38,0:15:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Young man!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.29,0:15:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to\Nfinish cooking with now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.75,0:15:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.79,0:15:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.71,0:15:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Give me my knives back!\N-Do not take my knives!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.54,0:15:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-No!\N-At least let me cut the meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.50,0:15:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.58,0:15:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How do they expect to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.63,0:15:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your knife.\NJust go, "Get out of here!"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.00,0:15:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This town is a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.46,0:15:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-We just need to check.\N-Ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.13,0:15:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Matilde…\Nhow can they treat us like criminals?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.13,0:15:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What right do you have?\NWe've done nothing to deserve this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.29,0:15:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't even cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.83,0:15:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,FREE AND SOVEREIGN MACONDO\NVOTE RED VOTE LIBERAL
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.79,0:15:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you\Nseizing our property?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.25,0:15:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do they think they are,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.08,0:15:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,coming in here\Nand taking whatever they want?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.46,0:15:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.21,0:16:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody's bothered to tell us anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.04,0:16:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-What do those posters say?\N-We have to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.58,0:16:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-We will.\N-But what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.13,0:16:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,School's closed!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.54,0:16:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,One nail draws out another.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.17,0:16:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.63,0:16:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-Anybody else with you?\N-No, we're alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.25,0:16:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.17,0:17:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-…decide our history!\N-Yeah! That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.21,0:17:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Because the flame\Nof the revolution burns
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.67,0:17:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,inside each one of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.67,0:17:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah!\N-And we're not alone in this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.67,0:17:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We are the majority!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.42,0:17:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And we are tired of living under\Nthe oppression of the Conservatives!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.13,0:17:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Out with the Conservatives!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.88,0:17:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And this town was founded on\Nthe very principles of liberty
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.00,0:17:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and equality for all!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.04,0:17:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Out with Conservatives!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.92,0:17:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That is why we all need\Nto get out and vote!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.92,0:17:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, that's right!\N-And we'll go out and vote with cojones!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.21,0:17:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We will vote with dignity and courage!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.92,0:17:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-Long live Macondo!\N-That's it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.21,0:17:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll go out there and vote
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.25,0:17:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,because Macondo has always been Liberal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.79,0:17:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Macondo's Liberal!\NMacondo's Liberal! Macondo's Liberal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.71,0:18:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Macondo's Liberal!\NMacondo's Liberal! Macondo's Liberal!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.08,0:18:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Macondo's Liberal! Macondo's Lib…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.75,0:19:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Elections are now officially open
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.75,0:19:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,for the first time ever\Nin the history of Macondo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.08,0:19:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,As instructed\Nby Doctor Noguera,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.25,0:19:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,the men submitting red ballots\Nhad to drink from their small bottle
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.92,0:20:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,as proof of their commitment\Nto the Liberal Party.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.13,0:20:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, next in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.58,0:21:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Two hundred and thirty-six votes total.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.83,0:21:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,One hundred and thirty-two\Nred ballots for the Liberal Party
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.33,0:21:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and 104 blue ballots\Nfor the Conservative Party.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.50,0:21:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll switch 'em then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.04,0:21:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,A hundred and thirty-two blue votes,\N104 red votes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.42,0:21:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you've finished, Sergeant,\Nthen seal the urn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.13,0:21:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow we'll send them off\Nto the capital to be counted.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.50,0:22:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were a Liberal,\Nthat'd be a reason for me to go to war.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.54,0:22:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My boy, lucky for you,\Nif you were a Liberal, son-in-law or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.08,0:22:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,you would've never seen this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.08,0:24:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.04,0:25:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That night, Rebeca managed\Nto thank God for having been born
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.29,0:25:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,before she lost herself\Nin the inconceivable pleasure
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.25,0:25:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,of that unbearable pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.96,0:25:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell your father-in-law\Nto return the knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.17,0:25:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ours and the whole town's.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.29,0:25:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We have nothing to cook with. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.96,0:25:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.08,0:25:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting married to Rebeca.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.75,0:25:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.83,0:26:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You two are siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.92,0:26:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get married in three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.33,0:26:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not asking for permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.83,0:26:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an atrocity.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.46,0:26:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you go through with it,\Nyou won't set foot in this house again!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.13,0:26:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.75,0:26:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You are all cordially invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.17,0:26:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Úrsula never forgave\Nwhat she considered to be
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.42,0:26:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,an inconceivable act of disrespect.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.29,0:27:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And Amaranta was never able to\Nget over her resentment towards Rebeca.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.21,0:27:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's begin with baton 14.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.17,0:27:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fourteen, please.\NLook at the pentagram.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.42,0:27:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.96,0:27:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,On my count.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.88,0:27:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.75,0:27:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.92,0:27:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.33,0:27:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.88,0:27:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four.\NOne, two, three, four-- Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.46,0:28:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-We're in class.\N-I'm marrying Rebeca.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.75,0:28:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're her brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.33,0:28:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not important.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.67,0:28:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.67,0:28:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's unnatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.04,0:28:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, the law forbids it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.00,0:28:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck what you think is natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.63,0:28:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what you think. Listen.\NI'm telling you myself, Pietro,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.63,0:28:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,so you don't bother going to Rebeca.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.67,0:28:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.04,0:28:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Moscote.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.96,0:29:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.71,0:29:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's too early for dominoes.\N-I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.04,0:29:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So then, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.88,0:29:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The knives, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.54,0:29:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now all of the women in Macondo,\Nincluding my mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.00,0:29:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,are angry that they have\Nnothing to cook with.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.79,0:29:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The knives have been sent\Nto the provincial capital
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.46,0:29:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,with the rest of the confiscated weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.25,0:29:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,as proof beyond dispute that the Liberals\Nare all preparing for war.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.79,0:29:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,General Medina sends\Nan urgent message from Manaure!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.67,0:29:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-What's happened? How are things?\N-The Conservatives stole the elections.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.42,0:29:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's been fraud nationwide.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.50,0:29:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There's certain areas\Nwhere Liberals are taking up arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.21,0:29:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We should be doing the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.17,0:29:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, to do the same,\Nwe'd need weapons ourselves, Arcadio!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.04,0:30:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.42,0:30:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,In Riohacha,\Nthey executed all of the Liberals
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.75,0:30:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,that decided to confront the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.96,0:30:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.83,0:30:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, we have come together\Nto celebrate the marriage
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.42,0:30:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,between José Arcadio Buendía\Nand Rebeca Buendía,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.58,0:30:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,who, contrary to the gossip and rumors\Nbeing spread around town,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.79,0:30:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,are not siblings!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.33,0:30:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,In the name of the Father,\Nthe Son, and the Holy Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.00,0:30:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.79,0:31:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.04,0:31:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Arcadio never knew\Nthat José Arcadio was his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.04,0:31:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, you're my wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.67,0:31:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.67,0:31:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.96,0:31:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebeca and José Arcadio rented\Na little house in front of the cemetery.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.58,0:31:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our house.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.38,0:31:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look over there! Don't look!\NDon't look!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.67,0:32:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And they settled in\Nwith no furniture but the hammock.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.67,0:32:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That night,\Na scorpion bit Rebeca on the foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.75,0:32:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But that did not keep them\Nfrom a scandalous honeymoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.88,0:32:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The town residents prayed\Nthat such unrestrained passion
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.38,0:32:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,would not disturb the peace of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.54,0:32:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-Do you have any knives, Catarino?\N-Not even one to cut a lime.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.25,0:32:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.13,0:32:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Catarino.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.13,0:32:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a drink, please, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.13,0:32:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys can keep talking.\NPretend I'm not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.25,0:32:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Aureliano,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.42,0:32:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,what do you believe your father would say
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.33,0:33:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,if he knew that you had become\Na Conservative in the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.38,0:33:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't identify\Nas Conservative or Liberal.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.04,0:33:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But if push came to shove,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.21,0:33:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,then I'd choose Liberal.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.17,0:33:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Conservatives are complete frauds.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.88,0:33:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.08,0:33:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure that's\Nreally what you think about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.00,0:33:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been more sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.50,0:33:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Catarino!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.58,0:34:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We are\Ncurrently planning a revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.17,0:34:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What sort of revolution?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.71,0:34:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, they're coordinating\Na series of attacks, nationwide actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.13,0:34:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,with the intention of killing\Nevery official for the Conservatives
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.21,0:34:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,and their respective families.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.46,0:34:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we need you on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.42,0:34:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We need your help\Nto kill Apolinar Moscote,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.92,0:34:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,his wife, and six daughters.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.79,0:34:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Conservatism must be\Ncut off at the source.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.75,0:34:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what, Noguera?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.63,0:34:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're neither a revolutionary
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.25,0:34:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,nor a Liberal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.92,0:34:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.00,0:35:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You are nothing but a butcher!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.33,0:35:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.13,0:35:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna know what you are,\NAureliano Buendía?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.21,0:35:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a guy that's too sentimental.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.04,0:35:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,A man with no vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.08,0:35:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me back the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.38,0:35:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be more than glad to.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.13,0:35:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.04,0:35:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a fucking coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.08,0:35:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And cowards never make history.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.00,0:35:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.54,0:35:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Pietro Crespi continued\Nhaving lunch at the house on Tuesdays,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.88,0:36:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,rising above the failure of his marriage\Nto Rebeca with a serene kind of dignity.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.50,0:36:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Amaranta looked after him\Nwith loving diligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.75,0:36:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,For Pietro Crespi,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.17,0:36:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,the woman whom he always considered\Nand treated as a child
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.21,0:36:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,was a revelation.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.67,0:37:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So what, then? Do you plan to kill me\Nlike you plan on killing the Moscotes?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.75,0:37:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-What?\N-Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.79,0:37:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you even talking about right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.46,0:37:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.38,0:37:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Those men outside that were following me.\NThat's what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.00,0:37:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We sent men to follow you,\Nbut not to murder you, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.42,0:37:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We knew it was a matter of time\Nbefore you gave our plan away.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.92,0:37:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.75,0:37:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.54,0:38:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.00,0:38:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If I wanted to rat on you,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.46,0:38:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I would've done it ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.08,0:38:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm not a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.29,0:38:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.92,0:38:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,the day you plan to kill my father-in-law…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.08,0:38:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,is the same day that I will be standing\Nby his door defending him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.75,0:39:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-Go on!\N-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.54,0:39:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This building…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.54,0:39:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.58,0:39:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,…is now property of the National Army!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.71,0:39:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-No, no! I teach at this school!\N-Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.46,0:39:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-Let her go!\N-Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.46,0:39:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-Let go of her!\N-Go clear the back rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.17,0:39:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay! Okay, okay, okay! Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.38,0:39:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-Keep moving! Keep moving!\N-Don't… don't touch her!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.83,0:39:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-Get out!\N-Don't! Don't… don't shoot! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.71,0:39:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Here. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.75,0:39:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Just get behind me. There.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.96,0:39:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Building secured! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.88,0:40:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We should get out of here. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.50,0:40:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No, please! Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.38,0:40:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-Help!\N-Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.96,0:40:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! You people have no right to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.46,0:40:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Criminals have no rights. Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.29,0:40:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-For God's sake, have mercy on this man!\N-Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.92,0:40:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.08,0:40:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-Please! This is a violation! Help me!\N-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.96,0:40:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-You have no right!\N-You are violating my rights!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.54,0:40:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-You have no right to do this!\N-Arcadio!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.13,0:40:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.13,0:40:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't try to be a hero.\NYou know those men can kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.96,0:40:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Those men are gonna\Nkill us all if we don't do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.21,0:40:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do this…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.46,0:40:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your choice, Aureliano!\NWhat side are you on?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.50,0:40:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,…without giving me a fair trial!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.38,0:40:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.29,0:40:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just execute\NAlirio Noguera like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.17,0:40:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Give your soldiers the order\Nto stop the execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.25,0:40:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid there's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.25,0:40:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's up to Captain Gómez now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.21,0:40:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.83,0:41:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they declare a state of emergency,\Nthe military's put in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.50,0:41:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.21,0:41:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Aim!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.00,0:41:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Long live the revolution!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.71,0:41:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.71,0:42:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-Nothing, just--\N-I asked you a question!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.96,0:42:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Please!\N-Tell me or hand it over!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.00,0:42:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hand it over!\N-Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.79,0:42:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll shut you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.88,0:42:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Ah! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.58,0:43:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.67,0:43:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.67,0:43:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.63,0:43:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.83,0:43:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.33,0:43:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.08,0:43:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, that dog had rabies.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.08,0:43:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, please, I need a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.29,0:43:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.83,0:45:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Aureliano, don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.54,0:45:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll get yourself killed out there.\NYou're not made for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.00,0:45:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Aureliano, son, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.00,0:45:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.17,0:45:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.29,0:45:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Aureliano, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.63,0:45:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of him as if he were your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.75,0:45:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And take care of yourself as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.21,0:46:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.46,0:46:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Aureliano, please don't leave me.\NPlease, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.38,0:46:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My son, please…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.67,0:47:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't leave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.50,0:47:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.38,0:47:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Aureliano?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.13,0:48:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's round up the men.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.83,0:48:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to go to war.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.88,0:48:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got no weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.92,0:48:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll use theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.63,0:48:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.67,0:48:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Aureliano.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.54,0:48:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Aureliano?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.50,0:48:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.58,0:48:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We're kicking the Conservatives\Nout of Macondo.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.08,0:48:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,There's me,\NGerineldo, Magnífico, and a few more.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.75,0:48:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.17,0:49:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Come fight with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.83,0:49:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We're joining\NGeneral Medina's revolutionary army.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.38,0:49:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already gone and seen\Neverything I needed to see out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.54,0:49:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My place is here now… with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.54,0:49:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.38,0:49:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Aureliano!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.83,0:49:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.54,0:49:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That night…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.88,0:49:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.50,0:49:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"It's like the whole world is shaking."
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.25,0:49:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you think we as men all fear death?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.04,0:50:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care and come back alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.25,0:51:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Aureliano.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.63,0:51:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.83,0:51:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.50,0:51:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.54,0:52:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! I can't just be executed\Nwithout being given a fair trial!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.54,0:52:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.17,0:52:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Honor the motherland!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.13,0:52:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire now!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.46,0:53:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Aureliano…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.88,0:53:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.63,0:53:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we joining General Medina?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.17,0:53:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.71,0:53:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to stay here instead and assume\Nthe post of civil and military chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.88,0:53:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep our home safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.58,0:54:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure we find this town\Nbetter than how we left it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.04,0:54:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.75,0:54:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now hurry and make sure\Neveryone's well armed.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.25,0:54:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.13,0:54:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! Don't kill me!\NDon't kill me! Don't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.50,0:54:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'm begging you. Don't kill me! Please!\N-Sh, sh, sh, sh, sh.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.42,0:54:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough, Moscote.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.08,0:55:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We freed Macondo\Nfrom the Conservatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.96,0:55:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But I assure you,\Nyou and your family are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.00,0:55:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.54,0:55:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this madness, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.50,0:55:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you gone insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.21,0:55:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't madness!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.50,0:55:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is war.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.17,0:55:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you ever call me "son" again.\NAm I clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.46,0:55:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,As of this very moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.63,0:55:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I am now Colonel Aureliano Buendía.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.46,0:57:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,BASED ON THE NOVEL BY\NGABRIEL GARCÍA MÁRQUEZ
